2026-07-20 09:50:19,092 - openai._base_client - DEBUG:505 - Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/chat/completions', 'headers': {'X-Stainless-Raw-Response': 'true'}, 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-cf2afd3d-9dbf-4467-a9fe-90f30834e05e', 'security': {'bearer_auth': True}, 'content': None, 'json_data': {'messages': [{'content': 'You are SQLBot\'s configuration assistant.\nYou help workspace admins manage **SQLBot system metadata** only:\ndatasources, selected tables/fields, connection check status, and source\nconfiguration (encrypted conf stored in SQLBot itself).\n\nHard rules:\n1. Only use the provided tools. Never invent tool names or free-form SQL execution.\n2. Never attempt to run business DML/DDL against customer databases.\n3. Never call or invent an execSql/runSql tool — it does not exist for you.\n4. Mutating tools (create/update datasource, choose tables, patch table/field\n   meta) require workspace admin. Read tools are always available to the\n   current user within their workspace.\n5. Datasource `configuration` is a **JSON string** of connection fields\n   (host/port/username/password/database/... or API endpoints conf). Pass\n   plaintext JSON to tools; the system encrypts before persist.\n6. Table projection (SQL-type datasources) uses `choose_tables`:\n   - mode="add" (default): **append** named tables to the current selection.\n     Prefer this when the user says add / 新增 / 加入 tables.\n   - mode="remove": drop named tables from the current selection.\n   - mode="set": full replace — the input list becomes the entire selection.\n     Never use mode="set" with only the new names (that deletes previous ones).\n   - Conf-owned resource types (e.g. API): tables/endpoints re-project from conf\n     on create/update; choose_tables cannot freely replace them — use\n     `update_datasource` with conf instead.\n7. After mutations, summarize what changed clearly. Prefer concise structured\n   answers; include ids/names the user needs for follow-up.\n8. If a tool returns an error, explain it and suggest the next safe step.\n9. Reply in the same language the user used.\n10. Prior turns in this conversation may appear above the latest user message —\n    use them for context; do not re-list entire catalogs unless asked.\n11. `update_table_meta` only edits metadata of an **already projected** table; it\n    cannot introduce a new table into the projection. Use choose_tables for that.\n12. Data preview uses `get_sample_data(ds_id, table_name)` only — protocol-level\n    CAP_SAMPLE_DATA preview (max 3 rows x 10 fields) on **already projected**\n    tables. Never invent SQL. If the user needs real analytics/charts, tell them\n    to use the main NLQ chat (not this configuration assistant).\n\nCookbook — add tables to a SQL datasource metadata projection:\n1. Resolve the datasource (list_datasources / get_datasource).\n2. Optionally list_selected_tables + list_catalog_tables to validate names.\n3. Call choose_tables(ds_id, tables=JSON[...], mode="add") with only the tables\n   to add (or the full desired set is fine under mode="add").\n4. list_selected_tables to confirm; report new vs remaining selections.\n5. Conf-owned (api): update_datasource conf, not choose_tables.\n\nCookbook — replace the full selection deliberately:\n1. Build the complete desired table list.\n2. choose_tables(..., mode="set") with that full list.\n\nCookbook — preview sample rows to validate a projection:\n1. Ensure the table is projected (list_selected_tables / choose_tables mode=add).\n2. get_sample_data(ds_id, table_name).\n3. Summarize the returned fields and a few sample values for the user.\n4. If CAP_SAMPLE_DATA unsupported or preview empty, explain and stop — do not\n   invent rows. Chart / metric analysis belongs in the main NLQ chat.\n\nAvailable capabilities via tools:\n- list / get datasources\n- create / update datasource (metadata + encrypted conf)\n- check connection status\n- list remote catalog tables/fields (read-only)\n- list selected metadata tables/fields\n- choose_tables (mode add|remove|set; default add) for non-conf-owned sources\n- update table/field checked flag and custom comments\n- get_sample_data: protocol preview (3 rows x 10 fields) for projected tables\n', 'role': 'system'}, {'content': "我现在有一个实际业务场景的需求，以下是其统计数据的实际sql 语句，请根据实际sql 语句添加AIO 的表以及表关系\n\n1、统计时间范围内技术研发中心每个人在系统迭代内每月负责的story,task,用例数\nSELECT\n    k.organization_name   AS 部门,\n    k.person_name         AS 姓名,\n    k.month               AS 月份,\n    k.code                AS 系统编码,\n    k.project_name        AS 系统名称,\n    k.sprint_name         AS 迭代名称,\n    IFNULL(ss.total_stories, 0) AS story数,\n    IFNULL(ts.total_tasks, 0)   AS task数,\n    IFNULL(cs.total_case, 0)    AS 案例数\nFROM (\n    /* 维度全集：story侧 + 任务侧 + 用例侧出现过的 (部门,姓名,项目,迭代,月) */\n    SELECT organization_name, person_name, code, project_id, project_name, sprint_id, sprint_name, month\n    FROM (\n        /* Story维度 - 使用dispatch_to_name作为开发人员，从d_user获取部门 */\n        SELECT DISTINCT\n            u_org.organization_name,\n            s.dispatch_to_name AS person_name,\n            a.code,\n            a.id   AS project_id,\n            a.project_name AS project_name,\n            d.id   AS sprint_id,\n            d.name AS sprint_name,\n            DATE_FORMAT(d.actual_end_time, '%Y-%m') AS month\n        FROM aio.d_story s\n        LEFT JOIN aio.d_project a ON a.id = s.project_id\n        LEFT JOIN aio.d_sprint d ON d.id = s.sprint_id\n        LEFT JOIN aio.d_user u ON u.name = s.dispatch_to_name\n        LEFT JOIN aio.d_organization u_org ON u_org.id = u.org\n        LEFT JOIN aio.d_organization_flat_detail u_org_flat ON u_org_flat.sub_org_id = u_org.id\n        WHERE s.deleted = '0'\n          AND d.actual_end_time IS NOT NULL\n          AND DATE_FORMAT(d.actual_end_time, '%Y-%m-%d') >= '2026-01-01'\n          AND DATE_FORMAT(d.actual_end_time, '%Y-%m-%d') <= '2026-06-30'\n          AND u_org_flat.org_name = '技术研发中心'\n          AND s.dispatch_to_name IS NOT NULL\n          AND s.dispatch_to_name != ''\n          AND u.org IS NOT NULL\n\n        UNION\n\n        /* Task维度 - 使用dispatch_to_name作为分配人，从d_user获取部门 */\n        SELECT DISTINCT\n            u_org.organization_name,\n            t.dispatch_to_name AS person_name,\n            a.code,\n            a.id   AS project_id,\n            a.project_name AS project_name,\n            d.id   AS sprint_id,\n            d.name AS sprint_name,\n            DATE_FORMAT(d.actual_end_time, '%Y-%m') AS month\n        FROM aio.d_task t\n        LEFT JOIN aio.d_project a ON a.id = t.project_id\n        LEFT JOIN aio.d_sprint d ON d.id = t.sprint_id\n        LEFT JOIN aio.d_user u ON u.name = t.dispatch_to_name\n        LEFT JOIN aio.d_organization u_org ON u_org.id = u.org\n        LEFT JOIN aio.d_organization_flat_detail u_org_flat ON u_org_flat.sub_org_id = u_org.id\n        WHERE t.deleted = '0'\n          AND d.actual_end_time IS NOT NULL\n          AND DATE_FORMAT(d.actual_end_time, '%Y-%m-%d') >= '2026-01-01'\n          AND DATE_FORMAT(d.actual_end_time, '%Y-%m-%d') <= '2026-06-30'\n          AND u_org_flat.org_name = '技术研发中心'\n          AND t.dispatch_to_name IS NOT NULL\n          AND t.dispatch_to_name != ''\n          AND u.org IS NOT NULL\n\n        UNION\n\n        /* Case维度 - 使用d_qa_result.test_by作为执行人，从d_user获取部门 */\n        SELECT DISTINCT\n            u_org.organization_name,\n            qr.test_by AS person_name,\n            a.code,\n            a.id   AS project_id,\n            a.project_name AS project_name,\n            d.id   AS sprint_id,\n            d.name AS sprint_name,\n            DATE_FORMAT(d.actual_end_time, '%Y-%m') AS month\n        FROM aio.d_qa_case qc\n        LEFT JOIN aio.d_qa_result qr ON qr.case_id = qc.id\n        LEFT JOIN aio.d_qa_plan p ON p.plan_id = qr.plan_id\n        LEFT JOIN aio.d_project a ON a.id = p.project_id\n        LEFT JOIN aio.d_sprint d ON d.id = p.sprint_id\n        LEFT JOIN aio.d_user u ON u.name = qr.test_by\n        LEFT JOIN aio.d_organization u_org ON u_org.id = u.org\n        LEFT JOIN aio.d_organization_flat_detail u_org_flat ON u_org_flat.sub_org_id = u_org.id\n        WHERE qc.deleted = '0'\n          AND d.actual_end_time IS NOT NULL\n          AND DATE_FORMAT(d.actual_end_time, '%Y-%m-%d') >= '2026-01-01'\n          AND DATE_FORMAT(d.actual_end_time, '%Y-%m-%d') <= '2026-06-30'\n          AND u_org_flat.org_name = '技术研发中心'\n          AND qr.test_by IS NOT NULL\n          AND qr.test_by != ''\n          AND u.org IS NOT NULL\n    ) u\n) k\nLEFT JOIN (\n    /* Story统计 - 按开发人员统计，从d_user获取部门 */\n    SELECT\n        u_org.organization_name,\n        s.dispatch_to_name AS person_name,\n        a.code,\n        a.id   AS project_id,\n        a.project_name AS project_name,\n        d.id   AS sprint_id,\n        d.name AS sprint_name,\n        DATE_FORMAT(d.actual_end_time, '%Y-%m') AS month,\n        COUNT(s.id) AS total_stories\n    FROM aio.d_story s\n    LEFT JOIN aio.d_project a ON a.id = s.project_id\n    LEFT JOIN aio.d_sprint d ON d.id = s.sprint_id\n    LEFT JOIN aio.d_user u ON u.name = s.dispatch_to_name\n    LEFT JOIN aio.d_organization u_org ON u_org.id = u.org\n    LEFT JOIN aio.d_organization_flat_detail u_org_flat ON u_org_flat.sub_org_id = u_org.id\n    WHERE s.deleted = '0'\n      AND d.actual_end_time IS NOT NULL\n      AND DATE_FORMAT(d.actual_end_time, '%Y-%m-%d') >= '2026-01-01'\n      AND DATE_FORMAT(d.actual_end_time, '%Y-%m-%d') <= '2026-06-30'\n      AND u_org_flat.org_name = '技术研发中心'\n      AND s.dispatch_to_name IS NOT NULL\n      AND s.dispatch_to_name != ''\n      AND u.org IS NOT NULL\n    GROUP BY u_org.organization_name, s.dispatch_to_name, a.id, a.project_name, d.id, d.name, DATE_FORMAT(d.actual_end_time, '%Y-%m')\n) ss ON ss.organization_name = k.organization_name\n    AND ss.person_name = k.person_name\n    AND ss.project_id = k.project_id\n    AND ss.sprint_id = k.sprint_id\n    AND ss.month = k.month\nLEFT JOIN (\n    /* Task统计 - 按分配人统计，从d_user获取部门 */\n    SELECT\n        u_org.organization_name,\n        t.dispatch_to_name AS person_name,\n        a.code,\n        a.id   AS project_id,\n        a.project_name AS project_name,\n        d.id   AS sprint_id,\n        d.name AS sprint_name,\n        DATE_FORMAT(d.actual_end_time, '%Y-%m') AS month,\n        COUNT(t.id) AS total_tasks\n    FROM aio.d_task t\n    LEFT JOIN aio.d_project a ON a.id = t.project_id\n    LEFT JOIN aio.d_sprint d ON d.id = t.sprint_id\n    LEFT JOIN aio.d_user u ON u.name = t.dispatch_to_name\n    LEFT JOIN aio.d_organization u_org ON u_org.id = u.org\n    LEFT JOIN aio.d_organization_flat_detail u_org_flat ON u_org_flat.sub_org_id = u_org.id\n    WHERE t.deleted = '0'\n      AND d.actual_end_time IS NOT NULL\n      AND DATE_FORMAT(d.actual_end_time, '%Y-%m-%d') >= '2026-01-01'\n      AND DATE_FORMAT(d.actual_end_time, '%Y-%m-%d') <= '2026-06-30'\n      AND u_org_flat.org_name = '技术研发中心'\n      AND t.dispatch_to_name IS NOT NULL\n      AND t.dispatch_to_name != ''\n      AND u.org IS NOT NULL\n    GROUP BY u_org.organization_name, t.dispatch_to_name, a.id, a.project_name, d.id, d.name, DATE_FORMAT(d.actual_end_time, '%Y-%m')\n) ts ON ts.organization_name = k.organization_name\n    AND ts.person_name = k.person_name\n    AND ts.project_id = k.project_id\n    AND ts.sprint_id = k.sprint_id\n    AND ts.month = k.month\nLEFT JOIN (\n    /* Case统计 - 按执行人统计，从d_user获取部门 */\n    SELECT\n        u_org.organization_name,\n        qr.test_by AS person_name,\n        a.code,\n        a.id   AS project_id,\n        a.project_name AS project_name,\n        d.id   AS sprint_id,\n        d.name AS sprint_name,\n        DATE_FORMAT(d.actual_end_time, '%Y-%m') AS month,\n        COUNT(DISTINCT qc.id) AS total_case\n    FROM aio.d_qa_case qc\n    LEFT JOIN aio.d_qa_result qr ON qr.case_id = qc.id\n    LEFT JOIN aio.d_qa_plan p ON p.plan_id = qr.plan_id\n    LEFT JOIN aio.d_project a ON a.id = p.project_id\n    LEFT JOIN aio.d_sprint d ON d.id = p.sprint_id\n    LEFT JOIN aio.d_user u ON u.name = qr.test_by\n    LEFT JOIN aio.d_organization u_org ON u_org.id = u.org\n    LEFT JOIN aio.d_organization_flat_detail u_org_flat ON u_org_flat.sub_org_id = u_org.id\n    WHERE qc.deleted = '0'\n      AND d.actual_end_time IS NOT NULL\n      AND DATE_FORMAT(d.actual_end_time, '%Y-%m-%d') >= '2026-01-01'\n      AND DATE_FORMAT(d.actual_end_time, '%Y-%m-%d') <= '2026-06-30'\n      AND u_org_flat.org_name = '技术研发中心'\n      AND qr.test_by IS NOT NULL\n      AND qr.test_by != ''\n      AND u.org IS NOT NULL\n    GROUP BY u_org.organization_name, qr.test_by, a.id, a.project_name, d.id, d.name, DATE_FORMAT(d.actual_end_time, '%Y-%m')\n) cs ON cs.organization_name = k.organization_name\n    AND cs.person_name = k.person_name\n    AND cs.project_id = k.project_id\n    AND cs.sprint_id = k.sprint_id\n    AND cs.month = k.month\nORDER BY k.organization_name, k.code, k.sprint_id, k.person_name, k.month;\n", 'role': 'user'}], 'model': 'xiaomi/mimo-v2.5-pro', 'stream': False, 'temperature': 0.7, 'tools': [{'type': 'function', 'function': {'name': 'list_datasources', 'description': 'List datasources in the current workspace (credentials redacted).', 'parameters': {'properties': {}, 'type': 'object'}}}, {'type': 'function', 'function': {'name': 'get_datasource', 'description': 'Get one datasource by id (credentials redacted).', 'parameters': {'properties': {'ds_id': {'description': 'Datasource id', 'type': 'integer'}}, 'required': ['ds_id'], 'type': 'object'}}}, {'type': 'function', 'function': {'name': 'create_datasource', 'description': 'Create a datasource. configuration is plaintext JSON; system encrypts. Requires workspace admin.', 'parameters': {'properties': {'name': {'description': 'Datasource name', 'type': 'string'}, 'type': {'description': 'Protocol type key, e.g. mysql/pg/excel/api (not display name)', 'type': 'string'}, 'configuration': {'description': 'Datasource configuration as a JSON string (plaintext; system encrypts)', 'type': 'string'}, 'description': {'default': '', 'description': 'Optional description', 'type': 'string'}, 'tables': {'anyOf': [{'type': 'string'}, {'type': 'null'}], 'default': None, 'description': 'Optional JSON array of tables for initial selection, each item {"table_name": "...", "table_comment": "..."}. Ignored for conf-owned resource types which re-project from conf.'}}, 'required': ['name', 'type', 'configuration'], 'type': 'object'}}}, {'type': 'function', 'function': {'name': 'update_datasource', 'description': 'Update datasource name/description/configuration/type. Conf-owned resources re-project tables from conf. Requires ws admin.', 'parameters': {'properties': {'ds_id': {'description': 'Datasource id to update', 'type': 'integer'}, 'name': {'anyOf': [{'type': 'string'}, {'type': 'null'}], 'default': None, 'description': 'New name'}, 'description': {'anyOf': [{'type': 'string'}, {'type': 'null'}], 'default': None, 'description': 'New description'}, 'configuration': {'anyOf': [{'type': 'string'}, {'type': 'null'}], 'default': None, 'description': 'New configuration JSON string (plaintext; system encrypts)'}, 'type': {'anyOf': [{'type': 'string'}, {'type': 'null'}], 'default': None, 'description': 'Protocol type key if changing type'}}, 'required': ['ds_id'], 'type': 'object'}}}, {'type': 'function', 'function': {'name': 'check_datasource', 'description': 'Check datasource connection status.', 'parameters': {'properties': {'ds_id': {'description': 'Datasource id', 'type': 'integer'}}, 'required': ['ds_id'], 'type': 'object'}}}, {'type': 'function', 'function': {'name': 'list_catalog_tables', 'description': 'Read-only: list remote catalog tables for a datasource.', 'parameters': {'properties': {'ds_id': {'description': 'Datasource id', 'type': 'integer'}}, 'required': ['ds_id'], 'type': 'object'}}}, {'type': 'function', 'function': {'name': 'list_selected_tables', 'description': 'List tables currently projected into SQLBot metadata for a datasource.', 'parameters': {'properties': {'ds_id': {'description': 'Datasource id', 'type': 'integer'}}, 'required': ['ds_id'], 'type': 'object'}}}, {'type': 'function', 'function': {'name': 'choose_tables', 'description': 'Update SQL-type datasource table projection. mode="add" (default) merges tables into current selection; mode="remove" drops named tables; mode="set" fully replaces selection with the input list. Conf-owned types re-project from conf instead. Requires ws admin.', 'parameters': {'properties': {'ds_id': {'description': 'Datasource id', 'type': 'integer'}, 'tables': {'description': 'JSON array of tables involved in the operation, e.g. [{"table_name":"t1","table_comment":""},...]', 'type': 'string'}, 'mode': {'default': 'add', 'description': 'Projection mode: "add" (default) merges tables into current selection; "remove" drops named tables from current selection; "set" replaces the entire selection with the input list. Never pass mode="set" with only newly added names — that deletes the rest.', 'type': 'string'}}, 'required': ['ds_id', 'tables'], 'type': 'object'}}}, {'type': 'function', 'function': {'name': 'list_catalog_fields', 'description': 'Read-only: list remote catalog fields for a table name.', 'parameters': {'properties': {'ds_id': {'description': 'Datasource id', 'type': 'integer'}, 'table_name': {'description': 'Remote catalog table name', 'type': 'string'}}, 'required': ['ds_id', 'table_name'], 'type': 'object'}}}, {'type': 'function', 'function': {'name': 'list_table_fields', 'description': 'List fields stored in SQLBot metadata for a CoreTable id.', 'parameters': {'properties': {'table_id': {'description': 'CoreTable id', 'type': 'integer'}, 'field_name': {'anyOf': [{'type': 'string'}, {'type': 'null'}], 'default': None, 'description': 'Optional field name filter'}}, 'required': ['table_id'], 'type': 'object'}}}, {'type': 'function', 'function': {'name': 'update_table_meta', 'description': 'Update checked / custom_comment on a CoreTable. Requires ws admin.', 'parameters': {'properties': {'table_id': {'description': 'CoreTable id', 'type': 'integer'}, 'checked': {'anyOf': [{'type': 'boolean'}, {'type': 'null'}], 'default': None, 'description': 'Whether the table is selected/enabled'}, 'custom_comment': {'anyOf': [{'type': 'string'}, {'type': 'null'}], 'default': None, 'description': 'Custom comment stored in SQLBot'}}, 'required': ['table_id'], 'type': 'object'}}}, {'type': 'function', 'function': {'name': 'update_field_meta', 'description': 'Update checked / custom_comment on a CoreField. Requires ws admin.', 'parameters': {'properties': {'field_id': {'description': 'CoreField id', 'type': 'integer'}, 'checked': {'anyOf': [{'type': 'boolean'}, {'type': 'null'}], 'default': None, 'description': 'Whether the field is selected/enabled'}, 'custom_comment': {'anyOf': [{'type': 'string'}, {'type': 'null'}], 'default': None, 'description': 'Custom comment stored in SQLBot'}}, 'required': ['field_id'], 'type': 'object'}}}, {'type': 'function', 'function': {'name': 'get_sample_data', 'description': 'Protocol-level sample preview (max 3 rows x 10 fields) for an already projected table via CAP_SAMPLE_DATA. Not free SQL and not a chart pipeline. Use to validate projection; chart analysis belongs in the main NLQ chat.', 'parameters': {'properties': {'ds_id': {'description': 'Datasource id', 'type': 'integer'}, 'table_name': {'description': 'Already-projected table name (must exist as CoreTable under the datasource). Protocol-level sample only — not free SQL.', 'type': 'string'}}, 'required': ['ds_id', 'table_name'], 'type': 'object'}}}]}}
