tetime, 修改时间),\n(deleted:varchar, 删除状态，0-未删除，1-已删除),\n(self_result:varchar, 自测结论：PASS:通过、FAILED:不通过),\n(sprint_id:bigint, 迭代id),\n(project_id1:bigint, 系统id),\n(id:bigint, 用例id),\n(priority:varchar, 优先级),\n(describe_type:int, 1文本描述 2步骤描述),\n(test_count:int, 测试次数),\n(create_time:datetime, 创建时间),\n(update_by:varchar, 修改人),\n(case_url:longtext, 接口测试url地址),\n(test_times:int, 提测次数),\n(test_type:varchar, 测试类型：sit,uat),\n(title:varchar, 用例标题),\n(story_id:bigint, 关联需求),\n(text_describe:text, 文本描述内容),\n(is_smoke:int, 是否冒烟用例0否1是),\n(create_by:varchar, 创建人),\n(item_no:varchar, 编号),\n(is_api_case:int, 是否接口测试案例：1-是，0-否),\n(smoke_result:varchar, 冒烟结论),\n(type:varchar, 所属用例库，全量用例库，回归用例库)\n]\n\n\n【Sample Data】(first 5 rows, for chart reference)\n| department | person_name | month | code | project_name | sprint_name | story_count | task_count | case_count |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 华云/联盟普通用户 | 黄鹏-华云 | 2023-04 | wklt | 五矿龙腾多级流转本地化项目 | dev1.3.0 | 0 | 0 | 1.0 |\n| 时光/联盟普通用户 | 余华涛 | 2022-09 | jinmao | 金茂供应链金融管理平台 | 金茂1.6版本对接平裕保理 | 0 | 0 | 34.0 |\n| 时光/联盟普通用户 | 余华涛 | 2022-10 | jinmao | 金茂供应链金融管理平台 | 金茂V1.7 | 0 | 0 | 1.0 |\n| 时光/联盟普通用户 | 余华涛 | 2022-10 | tjdc | 中铁建房地产集团金融中台系统 | V1.2.1版本优化需求 | 0 | 0 | 1.0 |\n| 时光/联盟普通用户 | 余华涛 | 2022-12 | tjdc | 中铁建房地产集团金融中台系统 | 铁建V1.5.0 | 0 | 0 | 2.0 |\n</m-schema>\n<chart-type>\ntable\n</chart-type>\n", 'role': 'user'}, {'content': '{\n  "type": "table",\n  "title": "工作量多维统计",\n  "columns": [\n    {"name": "部门", "value": "department"},\n    {"name": "姓名", "value": "person_name"},\n    {"name": "月份", "value": "month"},\n    {"name": "系统编码", "value": "code"},\n    {"name": "系统名称", "value": "project_name"},\n    {"name": "迭代名称", "value": "sprint_name"},\n    {"name": "story数", "value": "story_count"},\n    {"name": "task数", "value": "task_count"},\n    {"name": "用例数", "value": "case_count"}\n  ]\n}', 'role': 'assistant'}, {'content': "## 请根据上述要求，使用语言：简体中文 进行回答，若有深度思考过程，则思考过程也需要使用 简体中文 输出\n## 回答中不需要输出你的分析，请直接输出符合要求的JSON\n## 必须注意：不论要求你用什么语言回答，生成图表结构中的value字段内容必须与提供的SQL中提供的字段别名的字符保持一致！\n<user-question>\n统计今年的就行了\n</user-question>\n<sql>\nSELECT `department`,\n       `person_name`,\n       `month`,\n       `code`,\n       `project_name`,\n       `sprint_name`,\n       SUM(`story_count`) AS `story_count`,\n       SUM(`task_count`) AS `task_count`,\n       SUM(`case_count`) AS `case_count`\nFROM\n  (SELECT `u`.`organization_name` AS `department`,\n          `u`.`name` AS `person_name`,\n          DATE_FORMAT(`sp`.`actual_end_time`, '%Y-%m') AS `month`,\n          `p`.`code` AS `code`,\n          `p`.`project_name` AS `project_name`,\n          `sp`.`name` AS `sprint_name`,\n          COUNT(`s`.`id`) AS `story_count`,\n          0 AS `task_count`,\n          0 AS `case_count`\n   FROM `d_story` `s`\n   JOIN `d_user` `u` ON `s`.`dispatch_to` = `u`.`id`\n   JOIN `d_project` `p` ON `s`.`project_id` = `p`.`id`\n   JOIN `d_sprint` `sp` ON `s`.`sprint_id` = `sp`.`id`\n   WHERE `s`.`deleted` = '0'\n     AND YEAR(`sp`.`actual_end_time`) = 2026\n   GROUP BY `u`.`organization_name`,\n            `u`.`name`,\n            DATE_FORMAT(`sp`.`actual_end_time`, '%Y-%m'),\n            `p`.`code`,\n            `p`.`project_name`,\n            `sp`.`name`\n   UNION ALL SELECT `u`.`organization_name` AS `department`,\n                    `u`.`name` AS `person_name`,\n                    DATE_FORMAT(`sp`.`actual_end_time`, '%Y-%m') AS `month`,\n                    `p`.`code` AS `code`,\n                    `p`.`project_name` AS `project_name`,\n                    `sp`.`name` AS `sprint_name`,\n                    0 AS `story_count`,\n                    COUNT(`t`.`id`) AS `task_count`,\n                    0 AS `case_count`\n   FROM `d_task` `t`\n   JOIN `d_user` `u` ON `t`.`dispatch_to` = `u`.`id`\n   JOIN `d_project` `p` ON `t`.`project_id` = `p`.`id`\n   JOIN `d_sprint` `sp` ON `t`.`sprint_id` = `sp`.`id`\n   WHERE `t`.`deleted` = '0'\n     AND YEAR(`sp`.`actual_end_time`) = 2026\n   GROUP BY `u`.`organization_name`,\n            `u`.`name`,\n            DATE_FORMAT(`sp`.`actual_end_time`, '%Y-%m'),\n            `p`.`code`,\n            `p`.`project_name`,\n            `sp`.`name`\n   UNION ALL SELECT `u`.`organization_name` AS `department`,\n                    `u`.`name` AS `person_name`,\n                    DATE_FORMAT(`sp`.`actual_end_time`, '%Y-%m') AS `month`,\n                    `p`.`code` AS `code`,\n                    `p`.`project_name` AS `project_name`,\n                    `sp`.`name` AS `sprint_name`,\n                    0 AS `story_count`,\n                    0 AS `task_count`,\n                    COUNT(`c`.`id`) AS `case_count`\n   FROM `d_qa_case` `c`\n   JOIN `d_user` `u` ON `c`.`create_by` = `u`.`name`\n   JOIN `d_project` `p` ON `c`.`project_id1` = `p`.`id`\n   JOIN `d_sprint` `sp` ON `c`.`sprint_id` = `sp`.`id`\n   WHERE `c`.`deleted` = '0'\n     AND YEAR(`sp`.`actual_end_time`) = 2026\n   GROUP BY `u`.`organization_name`,\n            `u`.`name`,\n            DATE_FORMAT(`sp`.`actual_end_time`, '%Y-%m'),\n            `p`.`code`,\n            `p`.`project_name`,\n            `sp`.`name`) AS `combined`\nGROUP BY `department`,\n         `person_name`,\n         `month`,\n         `code`,\n         `project_name`,\n         `sprint_name`\nLIMIT 1000\n</sql>\n<m-schema>\n【DB_ID】 aio20240430\n【Schema】\n# Table: d_user, 用户信息表，name为姓名（关联story/task/qa_result中的人员），org为所属组织ID（关联d_organization.id）\n[\n(org:bigint, 机构ID),\n(name:varchar, 姓名),\n(related_bus_id:decimal, 关联业务id),\n(phone:varchar, 电话),\n(last_login_time:datetime, 最后登录时间),\n(enable:decimal, 是否有效，0无效，1有效),\n(create_by:varchar, 创建人),\n(organization_name:varchar, 机构名称),\n(table_head:text, 用户行为-表头),\n(company_name:varchar, 企业名称),\n(valid_date:date, 密码生效日期),\n(wc_job_id:varchar, 企微用户工号),\n(wc_depart:varchar, 企微全部部门id),\n(direct_leader_id:bigint, 用户直属领导ID),\n(new_direct_leader_id:bigint, 用户新直属领导ID),\n(user_name:varchar, 用户名),\n(user_type:varchar, 用户类型(管理员等)),\n(status:varchar, 状态),\n(email:varchar, 邮箱